# P2, member a (k7, PRESENCE2): steps off the lobby's entry point and stands; pictures of b's figure (b sends only
# PRESENCE: a client before round 60 or of an older hub) standing, walking past and standing right in front of a.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until epoch>=@84
goto 40 -70 3
idle until ghosts>=1 or epoch>=@110
log sees b
idle until epoch>=@100
shot a_p2_standing
idle until epoch>=@112
log b walks
shot a_p2_walk_1
idle until frames>=45
shot a_p2_walk_2
idle until frames>=45
shot a_p2_walk_3
idle until frames>=45
shot a_p2_walk_4
idle until frames>=45
shot a_p2_walk_5
idle until frames>=45
shot a_p2_walk_6
idle until epoch>=@150
log b back
shot a_p2_b_back
idle until frames>=600
